# Getting Started on ${SITE}

Welcome to your new cloud!

You have already found your files here at ${GITHUB_URL} for ${SITE} under the ${GITHUB_ORG} organization.

From here, you only need to do a few simple things.

- git clone this repo
- cp in your builder_admin.rc and bits
- Run `terraform init`
- edit your `main.tf` to enable/disable features
- Run `terraform plan`
- Run `terraform apply`
